{"version":1,"content":"<p>台灣女星林采緹當年憑「真人版蛇姬」形象走紅，F級火辣身材所向披靡，吸引到批粉絲追捧。</p><p>即使已經榮升人母但氣嶑不減，她在社交平台分享了一輯前往帛琉旅遊的美照，見她身穿比堅尼現身夢幻「牛奶湖」，火辣身材無所遁形。</p><p>&lt;br/&gt;&lt;br</p>","scraped_at":"2026-10-23T07:23:54.613007+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":113,"images":0,"source":"東網 娛樂","fallback":"rss-budget","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-10-23T07:01:32+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-23T07:18:03.674956+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-23T07:18:03.674956+00:00","content_hash":"38610515f222113d9d41c67ffcd7295c65470f6f3ce1f0dad23f791f04c71ecc","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}